### ============================================================================
### EXCHANGE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================================
### Operaciones de intercambio y precios

@api = https://servicioshilda.orioncaribe.com/api/v1
@accessToken = your_jwt_token_here
@tokenMint = D8TwbwGGmyucrxPB9uscait27caVgeqYHPpyN3XXjUX3

### ============================================================================
### 1. GET /exchange/solPriceCached - Get Cached SOL Price
### ============================================================================
### Obtiene el precio de SOL en caché
### NO requiere autenticación

GET {{@api}}/exchange/solPriceCached

### Response should be 200 OK with:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "solPriceUsd": 150.00,
###   "source": "coingecko",
###   "timestamp": "2024-01-01T12:00:00Z"
### }


### ============================================================================
### 2. GET /exchange/token-info - Get Token Information
### ============================================================================
### Obtiene información del token GAPC en Solana

GET {{@api}}/exchange/token-info?mint={{@tokenMint}}

### Response should be 200 OK with:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "mint": "...",
###   "name": "ProWallet",
###   "symbol": "GAPC",
###   "decimals": 9,
###   "supply": "...",
###   "holders": "..."
### }


### ============================================================================
### 3. GET /exchange/liquidity - Get Liquidity Information
### ============================================================================
### Obtiene información de liquidez del token

GET {{@api}}/exchange/liquidity?mint={{@tokenMint}}

### Response should be 200 OK with liquidity data


### ============================================================================
### 4. POST /exchange/swap - Perform Token Swap
### ============================================================================
### Realiza intercambio de tokens (si está implementado)

POST {{@api}}/exchange/swap
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}

{
  "inputMint": "So11111111111111111111111111111111111111112",
  "outputMint": "{{@tokenMint}}",
  "inputAmount": 1000000,
  "slippageTolerance": 0.05
}

### Response should be 200 OK with swap transaction


### ============================================================================
### 5. POST /exchange/withdraw - Request Token Withdrawal
### ============================================================================
### Solicita retiro de tokens a un wallet externo
### Requiere autenticación

POST {{@api}}/exchange/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}

{
  "amount": 100,
  "to": "4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8"
}

### Response should be 200 OK or 202 Accepted with:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "withdrawalId": "wd_12345",
###   "status": "pending",
###   "amount": 100
### }


### ============================================================================
### 6. GET /exchange/withdraw/status/:withdrawalId - Check Withdrawal Status
### ============================================================================
### Verifica estado de un retiro

GET {{@api}}/exchange/withdraw/status/wd_12345
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}

### Response should be 200 OK with withdrawal status


### ============================================================================
### 7. GET /exchange/rates - Get Exchange Rates
### ============================================================================
### Obtiene tasas de cambio

GET {{@api}}/exchange/rates?from=SOL&to=USD

### Response should be 200 OK with:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "from": "SOL",
###   "to": "USD",
###   "rate": 150.00,
###   "timestamp": "2024-01-01T12:00:00Z"
### }


### ============================================================================
### 8. GET /exchange/volume - Get Trading Volume
### ============================================================================
### Obtiene volumen de trading

GET {{@api}}/exchange/volume?period=24h

### Response should be 200 OK with volume data


### ============================================================================
### 9. GET /exchange/config - Get Exchange Configuration
### ============================================================================
### Obtiene configuración del exchange

GET {{@api}}/exchange/config

### Response should be 200 OK with configuration
